      "date": "2026-04-20T06:07:19.000Z",
      "title": "IRCTC: Dividend Payout And Margin Assumptions Will Likely Keep Shares Fairly Valued",
      "body": "Analysts have kept the ₹537 price target for Indian Railway Catering & Tourism unchanged, citing revised assumptions that now pair a 3.37% revenue growth outlook with a 32.48% profit margin and a forward P/E of about 33.89x. What's in the News A board meeting is scheduled for March 24, 2026 to review comments on fines levied by the exchanges for the quarter ended December 31, 2025, and to consider a change in the nomination of the Chief Investor Relations Officer (company filing).",
