      "title": "IRCTC: Interim Dividend And Board Actions Will Support Future Upside",
      "body": "Analysts have marginally raised their price target for Indian Railway Catering & Tourism to ₹1,157.74 from ₹1,157.31, linking this small revision to slightly updated expectations for revenue growth, profit margins and future P/E assumptions. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled for March 24, 2026, to review and approve comments on fines levied by the exchanges for the quarter ended December 31, 2025, and to consider a change in the nomination of the Chief Investor Relations Officer (company filing).",
